# Netlify forwarding rules: each project keeps its own Netlify site,
# and is shown here under mwerring.netlify.app/<project>/ (the address bar doesn't change).
# Netlify treats /project and /project/ as the same address, so don't add a separate
# "add the trailing slash" rule here: it loops forever. Each project fixes the slash itself.

/glamolotl/*    https://glamolotl.netlify.app/:splat   200

# MeView (when it's a web app):
# /meview/*     https://meview.netlify.app/:splat      200
